  "key_observations_html": "<div style=\"border:1px solid #C7D8E8;border-radius:10px;padding:0.75rem 0.95rem;margin:0.1rem 0 0.55rem;background:#ffffff;box-shadow:0 1px 3px rgba(15,23,42,0.06);\"><ul style=\"margin:0.1rem 0 0 1.05rem;padding:0;color:#1F4C67;font-size:0.9rem;line-height:1.45;\"><li><strong>RWA distributed value fell 5.1% over 30D:</strong> On-chain RWA distributed value at $14.11B (5.1% lower over 30D). Related: <a href=\"https://cointelegraph.com/magazine/vitaliks-pivots-to-eth-as-a-store-of-value-us-election-weighs-on-crypto-hodlers-digest?utm_source=rss_feed&amp;utm_medium=rss&amp;utm_campaign=rss_partner_inbound\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Vitalik \u2018pivots\u2019 ETH to store of value, crypto suffers after US midterms: Hodler\u2019s Digest</a> (CoinTelegraph).</li><li><strong>Tokenized U.S. Treasuries remain the institutional bridge into RWAs:</strong> adoption is strongest where products plug into cash management, collateral, and liquidity workflows. Related: <a href=\"https://thedefiant.io/news/defi/ondo-plans-tokenized-anthropic-shares-from-ipo-day\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Ondo Plans Tokenized Anthropic Shares From IPO Day</a> (The Defiant).</li><li><strong>Tokenized T-bill supply is still expanding through new products:</strong> That usually shows up first as new issuer and product supply, then as higher distributed value and denser collateral-style use across networks and platforms. Related: <a href=\"https://www.coindesk.com/business/2026/11/06/solana-lset-for-its-first-tokenized-stock-venue-under-sec-framework-listing-galaxy\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Solana set for its first tokenized stock venue under SEC framework, listing Galaxy</a> (CoinDesk).</li><li><strong>Regulatory framing still decides product access:</strong> Clearer rules tend to unlock balance-sheet participation and collateral workflows even when aggregate on-chain totals reprice slowly. Related: <a href=\"https://cointelegraph.com/news/robinhood-us-ipo-access-uk-retail-investors?utm_source=rss_feed&amp;utm_medium=rss&amp;utm_campaign=rss_partner_inbound\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Robinhood opens access to US IPOs for UK retail investors</a> (CoinTelegraph).</li></ul><p class=\"takeaways__note\">Context only\u2014not investment advice. Bullets combine on-page data with recent industry headlines.</p></div><p class=\"review-note ko-disclaimer\">Key observations are AI generated and should be reviewed for accuracy.</p>",
